title: Desktop Wallpaper Changed to Ransom Note
id: 5cd637c0-9467-4133-bdb9-410e884117df
status: experimental
description: Detects programmatic replacement of the desktop wallpaper via the Wallpaper registry value or reg add to Control Panel Desktop, a defacement step ransomware uses to display its ransom message.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1491/001/
logsource:
  product: windows
  category: registry_set
detection:
  selection:
    TargetObject|endswith: '\\Control Panel\\Desktop\\Wallpaper'
  selection_susp:
    Details|contains:
      - '\\Temp\\'
      - '\\ProgramData\\'
      - '.bmp'
      - '.jpg'
  condition: selection and selection_susp
  condition: selection
fields:
  - TargetObject
  - Details
  - Image
falsepositives:
  - Users or GPO changing wallpaper
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.impact
  - attack.t1491.001
